{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20266erjVCh3R61793254588.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>吉利汽車上季按年多賺兩成七，至48億元人民幣。收入升一成，至989億元人民幣，主要受惠出口銷量大幅增長及高價值產品銷售佔比提升。第三季銷量逾81萬輛，增長百分之6。</p><p></p><p>首三季純利139億元人民幣，增長百分之6。收入2,725億元人民幣，增加一成三。期內銷量上升百分之3，至逾223萬輛。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:34.675230+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T19:58:08.317386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:19.453429+00:00","content_hash":"1d05b35bf55ee0e1193fb2dfd673f3669925040b0b82dd2f2ab1109f3ac948dc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:34.675230+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}